      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794794897957,
      "created": 1794794897957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "slidesOrder": 7,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "chart",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "excalidraw",
          "accent": "violet",
          "decor": true
        },
        "presenterNotes": "- November 16, 2026: real openai/text-embedding-3-small embeddings over 288 similar saved invoice EAs (12 contacts, 24 invoices each).\n- Hybrid recall@10/@30: 34/34 and 34/34. Keyword-only: 24/34 and 34/34. Semantic-only: 34/34 and 34/34.\n- Twelve exact-identifier cases bypass ranking; both ambiguity cases are scored separately. All modes share the same production identity guards.\n- Three full IA/EA owner selections and one clarification passed. The original 3/4 score remains; 4/4 is a numeric-format rescore with no new model calls.\n- Semantic-only matched hybrid in this corpus; the chart keeps that comparison visible.\n- Sources: docs/evaluation/retrieval-hard-results.json and docs/evaluation/README.md."
      },
      "name": "08 — Retrieval quality"
    },
    {
      "id": "IWR2DDaksKDLMac2t3gDz",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 13076,
      "y": 2988,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1934647751,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1838474310,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794794898016,
      "created": 1794794898016,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "slidesOrder": 8,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "chart",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "excalidraw",
          "accent": "violet",
          "decor": true
        },
        "presenterNotes": "- Production history / summary budgets: 8,000 / 2,000 estimated tokens.\n- The full 72-exchange stored journal is 16,502 estimated tokens; the bounded working context after four real summaries is 1,599.\n- All 215 original source events remain intact. Original amount, corrected amount, exact identifiers and pending approval each passed.\n- Passing requires exact structured facts, original source reads and verified citations, no attempted external write and preserved pending approval.\n- This validates summary plus source retrieval, not summary-only recall. Estimated context sizes are not total provider prompt tokens.\n- Source: docs/evaluation/memory-results.json, latest production attempt."
      },
      "name": "09 — Memory preservation"
    },
    {
      "id": "fLxsJAvSeUdH_rIgpV0CD",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 16336,
      "y": 2988,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
